    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a good start. I'm particularly worried about people who sit for long periods and start feeling those small, nagging aches and pains in their wrists or necks. How can I describe those symptoms in the memo so people take them seriously without sounding too alarmist or scary?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
