      "content": "You can describe the symptoms in a way that emphasizes the importance of prompt attention, without sounding alarmist. For example, \"Please be aware of any discomfort or dulled sensations in your wrists, neck, or shoulders, particularly if these issues seem to worsen or follow repetitive tasks or workspace arrangements.\" This approach encourages employees to recognize the potential warning signs and consult with a healthcare professional if their symptoms persist.",
